{{also|devanagari|devanágari|Dēvanāgarī}}
==English==
[[File:Chandas typeface specimen.svg|thumb|Devanagari script (vowels top, consonants bottom) in {{w|Chandas (typeface)|Chandas font}}.]]

===Etymology===
From {{bor|en|sa|देवनागरी}}, compound of {{m|sa|देव||deity, divine}} + {{m|sa|नगर||town, city}}.<!--The name Devanagari should therefore be understood as “excellent or perfected form of the Nagari script”.-->

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|en|/ˌdeɪvəˈnɑːɡ(ə)ɹɪ/|/ˌdɛvəˈnɑːɡ(ə)ɹɪ/}}
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|en|/ˌdeɪvəˈnɑɡəɹi/}}
* {{audio|en|en-us-Devanagari.ogg|Audio (US)}}

